# Database Standards

Database

PostgreSQL

ORM

Ent

Migration

Atlas

---

# Naming

Tables

snake_case

Plural

Examples

users

reservations

membership_tiers

reward_redemptions

---

# Columns

snake_case

Examples

created_at

updated_at

deleted_at

customer_id

reservation_date

---

# Primary Key

id

UUID

Never integer auto increment.

---

# Foreign Keys

Always explicit.

Never implicit relationships.

---

# Timestamps

Every table:

created_at

updated_at

deleted_at

---

# Audit Fields

When applicable

created_by

updated_by

deleted_by

---

# Soft Delete

Prefer soft delete.

Avoid hard delete.

---

# Indexes

Create indexes only when justified.

Document why.

---

# Constraints

Always define:

Foreign Keys

Unique Constraints

Check Constraints

---

# Transactions

Use transactions when updating multiple entities.

---

# Seed

Provide seed data for:

Roles

Permissions

Membership Tiers

Reward Types

Settings

Admin User

---

# Goal

Data integrity first.